
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>TechNova | Digital Solutions</title>

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            background-color: #f8fafc;
            color: #1e293b;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* Navbar */
        .nav-bar {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 18px 8%;
            background-color: #0f172a;
            color: white;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 25px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #38bdf8;
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 25px;
        }

        .nav-links a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: white;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .nav-links a:hover {
            color: #38bdf8;
        }

        .nav-btn {
            text-decoration: none;
            background-color: #38bdf8;
            color: #0f172a;
            padding: 10px 18px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        /* Hero Section */
        .hero {
            min-height: 80vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 40px;
            padding: 70px 8%;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a, #1e3a5f);
            color: white;
        }

        .hero-content {
            max-width: 600px;
        }

        .hero-content span {
            color: #38bdf8;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 52px;
            line-height: 1.2;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .hero p {
            color: #cbd5e1;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            font-size: 17px;
        }

        .primary-btn {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 13px 24px;
            background-color: #38bdf8;
            color: #0f172a;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .hero-card {
            background-color: #1e293b;
            border: 1px solid #334155;
            padding: 35px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            width: 300px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 15px 35px #0003;
        }

        .hero-card .emoji {
            font-size: 65px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .hero-card h2 {
            color: #38bdf8;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        /* Common Sections */
        section {
            padding: 70px 8%;
            scroll-margin-top: 20px;
        }

        .section-heading {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .section-heading h2 {
            font-size: 34px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .section-heading p {
            color: #64748b;
        }

        /* Services */
        .services {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 25px;
        }

        .service-card {
            background-color: white;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .service-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-7px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px #00000010;
        }

        .service-card .icon {
            font-size: 35px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .service-card h3 {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .service-card p {
            color: #64748b;
        }

        /* About */
        .about {
            background-color: #eaf5ff;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .about-content {
            max-width: 750px;
            margin: auto;
        }

        .about-content p {
            color: #475569;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        /* Projects */
        .projects {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 25px;
        }

        .project-card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
        }

        .project-image {
            height: 160px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            font-size: 55px;
            background: #dbeafe;
        }

        .project-card:nth-child(2) .project-image {
            background: #dcfce7;
        }

        .project-card:nth-child(3) .project-image {
            background: #f3e8ff;
        }

        .project-info {
            padding: 22px;
        }

        .project-info p {
            color: #64748b;
            margin-top: 8px;
        }

        /* Contact */
        .contact {
            background: #0f172a;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .contact p {
            color: #cbd5e1;
            margin: 15px 0 25px;
        }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            background: #020617;
            color: #94a3b8;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        /* Responsive Design */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .nav-bar {
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 18px;
            }

            .nav-links {
                flex-wrap: wrap;
                justify-content: center;
                gap: 15px;
            }

            .hero {
                flex-direction: column;
                text-align: center;
                justify-content: center;
            }

            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 38px;
            }

            .hero-card {
                width: 100%;
                max-width: 320px;
            }

            .services,
            .projects {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .section-heading h2 {
                font-size: 28px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <!-- Navbar -->
    <header class="nav-bar">
        <div class="logo">TechNova.</div>

        <nav class="nav-links">
            <a href="#home">Home</a>
            <a href="#services">Services</a>
            <a href="#about">About</a>
            <a href="#projects">Projects</a>
            <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
        </nav>

        <a href="#contact" class="nav-btn">Get Started</a>
    </header>

    <!-- Home / Hero Section -->
    <main>
        <section class="hero" id="home">
            <div class="hero-content">
                <span>WELCOME TO TECHNOVA</span>

                <h1>We Build Digital <span>Experiences</span></h1>

                <p>
                    We help businesses grow with modern websites,
                    powerful web applications, and creative digital
                    solutions designed for the future.
                </p>

                <a href="#services" class="primary-btn">
                    Explore Our Services →
                </a>
            </div>

            <div class="hero-card">
                <div class="emoji">💻</div>
                <h2>Innovate. Create. Grow.</h2>
                <p>
                    Turning your ideas into powerful digital products.
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Services Section -->
        <section id="services">
            <div class="section-heading">
                <h2>Our Services</h2>
                <p>Everything you need to build your digital presence.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="services">
                <div class="service-card">
                    <div class="icon">🌐</div>
                    <h3>Web Development</h3>
                    <p>
                        Responsive and modern websites built to deliver
                        excellent user experiences.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="service-card">
                    <div class="icon">⚙️</div>
                    <h3>Web Applications</h3>
                    <p>
                        Powerful applications using modern technologies
                        to solve real business problems.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="service-card">
                    <div class="icon">📈</div>
                    <h3>Digital Growth</h3>
                    <p>
                        Improve your online presence through SEO,
                        marketing, and digital strategy.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- About Section -->
        <section class="about" id="about">
            <div class="about-content">
                <div class="section-heading">
                    <h2>About TechNova</h2>
                    <p>Technology meets creativity.</p>
                </div>

                <p>
                    At TechNova, we believe every great business starts
                    with a great idea. Our goal is to help startups and
                    established businesses turn those ideas into reliable,
                    user-friendly digital solutions.
                </p>

                <p>
                    From planning and design to development, we focus on
                    building solutions that make a real difference.
                </p>

                <a href="#contact" class="primary-btn">Work With Us</a>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Projects Section -->
        <section id="projects">
            <div class="section-heading">
                <h2>Our Projects</h2>
                <p>A few examples of what we can build.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="projects">
                <div class="project-card">
                    <div class="project-image">🏥</div>
                    <div class="project-info">
                        <h3>Healthcare Website</h3>
                        <p>
                            A modern platform for patients to discover
                            healthcare services and clinics.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="project-card">
                    <div class="project-image">🛒</div>
                    <div class="project-info">
                        <h3>E-commerce Platform</h3>
                        <p>
                            An online shopping experience with product
                            listings and a user-friendly interface.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="project-card">
                    <div class="project-image">📊</div>
                    <div class="project-info">
                        <h3>Business Dashboard</h3>
                        <p>
                            A clean dashboard concept for tracking
                            business data and performance.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Contact Section -->
        <section class="contact" id="contact">
            <h2>Have a Project in Mind?</h2>

            <p>
                Let's discuss your idea and build something amazing together.
            </p>

            <a href="mailto:hello@technova.example" class="primary-btn">
                Contact Us
            </a>
        </section>
    </main>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer>
        <p>© 2026 TechNova. All rights reserved.</p>
        <p>Designed with ❤️ for the digital future.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
